{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_09_beg","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":20,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_st03","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-9","storyName":"凛刃出匣","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"维多利亚大军压境，开斯特邀请恩希欧迪斯前往“荣光”号会谈。恩雅一行人抵达遗迹，她们离耶拉冈德的真相只有一步之遥。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_09_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_09","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":18,"next":20,"characters":["谢拉格老人","维多利亚士兵","忧心忡忡的行人","阴沉无奈的行人","怒不可遏的行人","开斯特亲卫队队长","开斯特公爵","“灰礼帽”","喀兰贸易员工","维多利亚大使","诺希斯","阿德颂","恩雅","茱安娜","埃琳娜"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_bg_45_g8_kjeragstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowfall","volume":"1","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"远方躁动的轰鸣惊醒了树梢上的寥寥落雪，本该静谧的街道弥漫着一丝不祥的温热。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"这里原本是圣山脚下通往蔓珠院的路，此时却有维多利亚的部队横亘道路中央，履带碾过路面，毫不避讳地留下不可逾越的障碍。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"战车上的喇叭传出清楚的谢拉格语——","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$radio","channel":"o","volume":"1","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"text","text":"“谢拉格居民们，请务必不要惊慌，依据维多利亚对当前态势的决策，我们会保障所有人的安全。”","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"“此次行动不会干扰居民正常生活，只是建议所有人，在这样的天气里待在家中。”","id":17},{"type":"text","text":"“也警告劫持维多利亚人士的不法分子，以及相关人士，立刻放归人质，否则我们会立刻采取行动！”","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"2","id":20},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":21,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_279_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"这位先生，可以让我过去对面吗？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"我想要回家生火，到吃饭的时间了，我的妻子在等着我......","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_408_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚士兵","text":"这里已经封锁了，绕道，或者待在这里。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_408_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_279_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"可......我只是要去马路对面。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"您担心安全，检查我身上的东西吧，除了食物，没有别的。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_408_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚士兵","text":"你是蔓珠院的人？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_408_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_279_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"我不属于蔓珠院，我只是个铁匠。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_408_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚士兵","text":"那么绕路，或者待在这里。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_408_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_279_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"这条道路我走了几十年......","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心忡忡的行人","text":"老人家，不要惹事，没有好处！","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉无奈的行人","text":"快离开那里吧！听他的！","id":42},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_408_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚士兵","text":"我不想再说第三遍。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_408_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_279_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"......","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"text","text":"老人蹒跚地离开车队，回头望去，妻子也在橱窗后望着他。","id":50},{"type":"text","text":"他摆摆手，让妻子离开。","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_279_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格老人","text":"耶拉冈德在上......我愿聆听你的盛怒......","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_279_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"charslot","id":57},{"type":"image","image":"67_i06","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"45","block":"false","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怒不可遏的行人","text":"你们怎敢入侵我们的土地！赶快滚开！听到了吗？滚出去！","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心忡忡的行人","text":"维多利亚人，维多利亚人......这些日子最恨的就是这几个字。","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心忡忡的行人","text":"......居然还有人在这时候敢掳他们的人。","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉无奈的行人","text":"看不出来吗，这显而易见只是最卑劣的借口，维多利亚人来了，谢拉格的天要变了......","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怒不可遏的行人","text":"*谢拉格俚语*，不光袖手旁观还讲这些丧气话，比饿了三天的驮兽还没出息，我就帮他们认识认识谢拉格！","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心忡忡的行人","text":"你要闹事就离远一点！别让他们以为我是跟你一伙的！","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉无奈的行人","text":"对，对，你去喀兰贸易，他们不是有保安吗？","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怒不可遏的行人","text":"一群废物......","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉无奈的行人","text":"废物？你有勇气，你在所不惜，你有家庭吗？","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉无奈的行人","text":"如果这是谈判的结果，如果三大家族，蔓珠院，喀兰贸易......他们都无所作为，我们能做什么呢？","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉无奈的行人","text":"耶拉冈德在上......请原谅我的畏惧，我的胆怯......","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"愤怒、畏惧、不安......各种情绪在手无寸铁的人群中弥漫，却无从撼动他们对面全副武装的军队。","id":74},{"type":"text","text":"直到他们的声音被引擎的轰鸣声淹没。","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"image","id":80},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"animtext","id":85,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>“荣光”号甲板</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":86},{"type":"animtextclean","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":88},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"阁下，我们的舰队已经完成了对谢拉格雪山入口的包围。","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"在谢拉格内部的先遣部队同样严密包围了蔓珠院，谢拉格的武装力量无力对我们发起反抗。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"谢拉格的圣女，现在不知所终。不过我们会确保，在她露面的第一时间，就锁定她的位置。","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"事态没有超出我们的掌控......所以请恕我直言。","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"阁下，您似乎没有必要亲临战场前线。","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_726_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"......不要急躁，菲利帕。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"注意你的言辞，我应该纠正过，谢拉格并非是我们的敌人，而是值得我们重视的合作伙伴。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"可是喀兰贸易，到现在还没有正式回应我们的谈判邀请。","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_726_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"呵呵......我能想象。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_726_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"恩希欧迪斯是个骄傲的人......想来要他消化这样一场失败，应该是无比艰难的事吧。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"菲利帕，你应该多少听说过他的故事，细算来，他也是你的血亲。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"我不理解，如果他当真如传闻中那样才学出众，又为何放弃留在您身边的机会，而甘愿埋没在这片深山中？","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_726_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"就像我说的，他的确是个骄傲的人。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"我可以给他一点时间......六个小时。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"如果谢拉格官方还是不肯接受我们的协议，那事情就只能以令人遗憾的方式收场了。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"明白。","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"可是阁下，还有一件不知是否算得上值得在意的小事。","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"那位在明面上已经是死人的布朗陶家的家主，我们又发现了她活动的痕迹。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"目前她正在黑骑士的保护下藏身在蔓珠院里。","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_726_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"嗯......我想在这种时候，恩希欧迪斯不会大费周章地隐藏一个丝毫不重要的人。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_726_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"虽然不值一提......但我不喜欢变数。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特公爵","text":"去找到她。找到她在隐藏的东西。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_726_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2013_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"开斯特亲卫队队长","text":"遵命，阁下。","id":128},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"image","id":133},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_bg_30_ex1_snowmount.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_867_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“灰礼帽”","text":"收到，我将执行有限度的调遣，等待进一步指示。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_867_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“灰礼帽”","text":"全体注意，一队守住正面，二队向北门进发，封锁那里，三四队寻找制高点盯住院内。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_867_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“灰礼帽”","text":"所有人，严阵以待，漏出去一个人，等着面见公爵。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_867_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"charslot","id":149},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_bg_45_g11_karlanheadquarters.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1162_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喀兰贸易员工","text":"先生，我并没有收到任何允许维多利亚人进入的命令。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1162_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"充分理解，我们会在此等待回复。","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1162_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喀兰贸易员工","text":"总裁已经通报，不接受任何邀约，您如果......","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1162_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"没有关系，我会在这里耐心等待，就像每一个谢拉格人等待严冬过去一样。","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"那么谢拉格人准备用什么方式度过今年的冬天呢？我很好奇。","id":163},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"你或许没机会亲身感受了。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我不代表我个人，我的体会也不重要，诺希斯先生。","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"平等地给予每个人表达的机会，我相信这种糟糕的状况下需要这种态度，您说呢？","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......你现在还有什么目的？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"请放心，喀兰贸易的现任总裁，诺希斯先生。","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我这次前来只带着一个再简单不过的任务——替公爵阁下向恩希欧迪斯先生发出谈判邀约。","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"只是一场简单的，以维护两国关系为目的的，和平的谈话。","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"你们公然派遣军队包围了谢拉格，用炮口对准平民，让士兵封锁街市。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"这些都是所谓的和平谈判的一部分？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"诺希斯先生......","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"公爵只是想让谢拉格真正的主人明白，疾驰的舰船并不在意甲板上的人向何处奔跑，但是对大多数人来说，最好的选择只有抓稳扶手。","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"深刻理解这点的过程可以很漫长，也可以在瞬息之间......取决于阁下已经获知的“命令”。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"这不算开门见山，维多利亚人，你应该不需要我来教你该说什么。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我更愿意称之为“请求”，诺希斯先生，来自维多利亚的请求，如今可不多见。","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我们诚挚邀请恩希欧迪斯先生，与公爵一道参加关于谢拉格未来的热切会谈。","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我们会保障会议顺利举行，公爵也已给出指示，没有人会受到任何伤害。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"那我们同样有自己的立场——维多利亚必须立即停止一切正在进行的军事入侵。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"很遗憾，这将取决于恩希欧迪斯先生与公爵阁下会谈的结果。而我没有资格替公爵做出许诺。","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"现在，我只希望能在足够温暖的地方度过这个冬天......一个小小的期望，它会是谢拉格。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"charslot","id":202},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":203},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lightsnow","layer":"1","id":204},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_30_ex1_snowmount_s.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":205},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"1","id":206},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"1","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":208},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":209,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"sticker","id":211,"text":"人们究竟该以何种面目，去面对祂呢","x":"180","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":212,"text":"我曾问过自己无数次，直到流下歉疚的泪水——因为我找不到答案","x":"180","y":"320","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":213,"text":"如同现在，我在风雪中踟蹰，什么都寻找不到","x":"180","y":"420","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":214,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":215,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":216,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"sticker","id":218,"text":"喀兰之心，只是一个故弄玄虚的修辞","x":"180","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":219,"text":"一幅梦中的绘画，一处山崖间的烂泥","x":"180","y":"320","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":220,"text":"蔓珠院说，人在濒临死亡时，会看见祂的面庞","x":"180","y":"390","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":221,"text":"我想，这是我最后的机会","x":"180","y":"460","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":222,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":223,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":224,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":225,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":226},{"type":"sticker","id":227,"text":"然而，我却无法向您证明任何事情","x":"180","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":228,"text":"我只看到了篝火旁的母亲、窗帘下的妻子","x":"180","y":"320","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":229,"text":"我本该拥有的生活","x":"180","y":"420","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":230,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":231,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":232,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":233},{"type":"sticker","id":234,"text":"您已读完这位无信的信徒为自己所写的墓志铭","x":"180","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":235,"text":"他最后恳求您","x":"180","y":"320","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":236,"text":"为他拭去碑上的霜雪","x":"180","y":"420","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":237,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":238,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":239,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"bgeffect","layer":"1","fadetime":"2.5","id":242},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.01","fadetime":"2.5","id":243},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.01","fadetime":"2.5","id":244},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":246},{"type":"bgeffect","id":247},{"type":"curtain","id":248},{"type":"text","text":"一个孤零零的坟墓挺立在路旁，恩雅与阿德颂在这座孤坟前驻足。","id":249},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"我只埋葬了他。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"他在临死前，只来得及为自己刻好墓碑。","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"所以，我们一路上遇到的尸骨，都是......","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"人的尸骨。","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"只有人才会用价值和意义麻痹自己......为了登上圣山，为了走到祂的身侧，见证祂的存在，他们愿意献出生命。","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"text","text":"圣女的右手拂过残损的木碑，完成了坟墓主人的心愿。","id":265},{"type":"text","text":"冷风划过她的指缝，仿佛想让她抓住什么，她抬头望向白雪覆盖的山脊，耳畔传来一阵年轻女子的笑声......","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"长老，您有听见——","id":268},{"type":"dialog","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"她咽下了疑问，这阵笑声在山脊间回响、渐弱，直到成为回忆。","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"我没听见什么。","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"圣女大人，请继续。","id":276},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":279},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":280},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅迟疑了一下，点点头，继续向着愈发晦暗的天际、厚雪覆盖的山顶走去。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"风雪翻涌，牵扯着圣女的衣装，雪粒挂在眉间，一如挂在她所走过的枯树。","id":284},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_30_ex1_snowmount_s.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#8$1","duration":"1.5","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"你多使使劲儿，光靠我拽你可跟不上恩雅——","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"呼，呼......不就，两步路的事儿，跟那么紧干嘛......","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#18$1","focus":"r","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"......对了。","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"刚才，他们在这里，对着什么在说话是不是？","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"嗯......我好像也看到了。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"可这里除了雪和山石之外什么都没有......唉，不管那么多了。","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1.5","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1.5","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"埃琳娜勉强踏出几步，而踩过的雪地正泛出幽蓝的荧光。","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"与此同时，她隐隐觉得在被人注视，但身边只有抱着她的手臂、咬着牙的茱安娜。","id":315},{"type":"text","text":"风吹得头脑麻木了，这肯定是什么错觉。当心中闪过这个念头时，埃琳娜听到一声叹息。","id":316},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"charslot","id":320},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"......您主动走进了一个必败的赌局。","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"圣女大人。","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"这里就是......","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"正是。","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"群山深处......“喀兰之心”的所在。","id":335},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"恩雅，我完成你给的任务，把她拖过来啦！","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"（压低声音）到了到了，别愣着。","id":344},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#8$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2.5","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"啊......","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"......等等，这，不对，绝不是这样！","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"text","text":"埃琳娜使劲摇头，她拍拍脸，提起大大小小的仪器在洞壁摆弄着。","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"这是一个在谢拉格随处可见的普通山洞，靠近圣山的顶峰似乎是它唯一特别之处，恩雅往更深处走去，呼吸也稍稍急促。","id":355},{"type":"text","text":"最深处到洞口仅百米，勉强排开五六人的宽窄，苔藓和地衣薄薄地覆盖岩石，空气中混杂真菌和泥土的味道，弥散着湿润的腥气。","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"你们不是最早想要寻找到祂的人，甚至我也不是......","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"我年轻时的夙愿，便是目睹祂的真容，真正跪倒在祂面前。为此，我在藏经阁翻遍每一本书，读尽每一行诗歌，寻觅祂存在的证据。","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"许多前人也留下过各类记录与辨析，有人提到过这里，圣山上唯一的洞窟。","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"我踏过崎岖漫长的山路，终于来到这里......","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"记载中，曾经有蔓珠院修士前往圣山深处避难。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"正是如此。","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"您或许还记得，那一位唤醒了耶拉冈德的圣女的故事。","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......传说中，耶拉冈德降下天罚，蔓珠院先后挑选了一百名少女上山祈福，最后的那位少女平息了祂的怒火。","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"然而真相是，最后的那位少女，是某位家族族长的女儿，因此引发了各大家族联合围攻蔓珠院。","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"在那场屠戮中，幸存下来的修士逃到这里，接着就是所谓“神迹”降临，谢拉格恢复和平。","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"您又会如何解释那次“神迹”？","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"看看如今的谢拉格，答案不言而喻，谁听说过能毫无理由戛然而止的战争？","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"连谋杀少女都能成为崇高的“神迹”，那么政治妥协当然也能被改编成宗教传说。","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"谋杀......长老如此看待蔓珠院当初的举动......","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"是的，以谋杀求得慰藉，任由心被愚昧所驱使，这是蔓珠院为“耶拉冈德”背负的血债。","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"没有可以担保永恒的神明，我们所走的每一步都如履薄冰，不可不慎。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"圣女大人，我已带您验明耶拉冈德的真相......","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"现在......无论您想挣扎多久，老朽都能等下去。","id":387},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"恩雅！你快来看！","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"最深处的这堆石头，不像是天然形成的，简直就是铺下来的一堵门。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"......过去的修士要把它打造成避难所，无论发现什么都不稀奇。","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"也就是说......在这扇“门”的背后，很可能就是当年蔓珠院修士的藏身所，也是隐藏了谢拉格无数秘密的所在......","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"更有可能的是，当你打开这扇门后，发现其中空无一物。","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"那就容我们见证，长老。","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"......","id":405},{"type":"dialog","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":408},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":409},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"圣女半合着双眼，她从滔滔不绝演说历史的老人身前走过，逐渐接近洞窟的尽头。","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"深深呼吸，让身子紧贴着尽头的洞壁，像是一个久违的拥抱。","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"泥土染上了双手与脸颊，发梢下露出苔痕，她仿佛是在大地上沉睡......","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我......感觉到了。","id":419},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"charslot","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"恩雅，探测器显示，在这一层很单薄的岩壁背后，似乎存在一个巨大的空洞。","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"但是这里没有别的入口......如果需要的话，我可以炸开它。","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"等等，你怎么敢对圣地——","id":427},{"type":"dialog","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"动手吧。","id":431},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"charslot","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":434},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"啊——恩雅？！","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"耶拉冈德在上......","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"为了真相，原谅我的无礼吧......！","id":439},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":443},{"type":"character","id":444},{"type":"image","id":445}],"characters":["谢拉格老人","维多利亚士兵","忧心忡忡的行人","阴沉无奈的行人","怒不可遏的行人","开斯特亲卫队队长","开斯特公爵","“灰礼帽”","喀兰贸易员工","维多利亚大使","诺希斯","阿德颂","恩雅","茱安娜","埃琳娜"]}